{"id":"bruja","lemma":"bruja","pos":"noun","rank":1512,"glosses":["witch, sorceress (woman who practices witchcraft)","specifically, a Wiccan","crone, hag (ugly, evil-looking, or frightening old woman)"],"ipa":"/ˈbɾuxa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"brujas","masculine":"brujo","masculinePlural":"brujos"},"order":1571,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-bruja.wav","formAudio":{"brujo":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-brujo.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"No soy una bruja.","en":"I'm not a witch.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734363","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La cacería de brujas ha comenzado.","en":"The witch hunt has begun.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"hunt, hunting"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to begin, to commence","l":"comenzar"}]},{"text":"Se pensaba que la mujer de extraña apariencia era una bruja.","en":"The strange-looking woman was thought to be a witch.","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to think, ponder","l":"pensar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"woman"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"China aster"},{"g":"appearance"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}